<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:11.135" end="00:00:13.155" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.200" end="00:00:51.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TO THE FOREST! GO! GO!</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.100" end="00:01:27.400" style="s2">GO! TAKE IT AWAY! GO!</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.400" end="00:01:59.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WAKE.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.200" end="00:01:59.600" style="s2">What was that?</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.692" end="00:02:30.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s alive.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.092" end="00:02:41.892" style="s2">Is this yours?</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.792" end="00:02:44.492" style="s2">I&#39;ve got it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.892" end="00:02:44.492" style="s2">I&#39;ve got it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.092" end="00:02:53.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The egg.</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.292" end="00:02:56.892" style="s2">BRING ME THE EGG.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.992" end="00:02:56.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; UP, WICK. UP.</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.782" end="00:03:02.802" style="s2">[groaning and snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.992" end="00:03:22.492" style="s2">HOLD ON. Hold on.</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.194" end="00:04:50.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t hide forever, girl.</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.263" end="00:05:24.283" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.094" end="00:05:33.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.894" end="00:05:43.694" style="s2">Get away from him.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.114" end="00:06:10.134" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.664" end="00:06:16.684" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.695" end="00:06:32.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy, Wick.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.595" end="00:06:40.919" style="s2">There you go.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.899" end="00:06:40.919" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.195" end="00:06:46.295" style="s2">One at a time.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.795" end="00:06:46.295" style="s2">Bless you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.195" end="00:07:03.595" style="s2">My mother was born in Holland.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.895" end="00:07:12.495" style="s2">We were one day away, Wick.</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.995" end="00:07:12.495" style="s2">One day.</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.300" end="00:07:35.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.395" end="00:07:35.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No! Stay behind me!</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.915" end="00:07:54.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter and clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.895" end="00:08:10.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.995" end="00:08:10.697" style="s2">Where Mara?</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.397" end="00:08:16.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s from Holland.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.797" end="00:08:18.997" style="s2">Their people</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.097" end="00:08:18.997" style="s2">and it&#39;s wearing off.</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.897" end="00:08:27.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Found you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.560" end="00:08:33.580" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.281" end="00:08:49.301" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.726" end="00:09:01.746" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.197" end="00:09:11.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Witch.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.441" end="00:09:36.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.266" end="00:09:46.286" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.597" end="00:10:11.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re flying.</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.897" end="00:10:11.197" style="s2">Witch, you&#39;re flying.</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.198" end="00:10:36.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay here, Wick. If I call you, come.</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.902" end="00:11:02.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.037" end="00:11:14.057" style="s2">[cough]</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.898" end="00:11:25.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The egg?</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.798" end="00:11:25.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gone with the girl.</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.798" end="00:11:35.198" style="s2">Feed them every dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.698" end="00:11:35.198" style="s2">Without the heart, they wake up.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.298" end="00:11:40.298" style="s2">And the girl,</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.998" end="00:11:43.398" style="s2">let her run to Karad. That is where</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.298" end="00:11:43.398" style="s2">Winter goes next.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.898" end="00:11:46.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Without the heart?</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.753" end="00:11:48.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.898" end="00:11:51.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop her!</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.898" end="00:11:57.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WICK, NOW!</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.999" end="00:12:32.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GIANTS ARE COMING FROM IRONHORN. Hollen</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.999" end="00:12:35.299" style="s2">is burned. Aran is gone.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.899" end="00:12:35.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aran.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.199" end="00:12:40.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And listen to me. The giants are our</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.299" end="00:12:43.299" style="s2">people.</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.499" end="00:12:43.299" style="s2">Don&#39;t kill them.</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.499" end="00:12:50.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Push again.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.218" end="00:12:56.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.099" end="00:13:03.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s in firewalls. No killing.</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.599" end="00:13:13.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s coming back.</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.199" end="00:13:18.899" style="s2">Go on, Skye.</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.599" end="00:13:37.299" style="s2">Easy, easy.</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.699" end="00:13:42.399" style="s2">Good girl.</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.499" end="00:14:05.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RUN INSIDE. GO.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.201" end="00:14:28.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BRING THE walls down.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.901" end="00:14:53.901" style="s2">Riders, up.</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.301" end="00:15:14.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Net.</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.201" end="00:15:14.001" style="s2">Use the net. Don&#39;t kill them.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.630" end="00:15:21.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.801" end="00:15:38.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Spy.</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.701" end="00:16:11.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The little white dragon again.</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.686" end="00:16:14.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.021" end="00:16:54.802" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.002" end="00:16:54.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now, Skye.</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.256" end="00:17:16.276" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.977" end="00:17:31.997" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.402" end="00:17:37.002" style="s2">Without the heart, they wake up.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.102" end="00:17:41.702" style="s2">The heart.</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.002" end="00:17:48.317" style="s2">Wick, Ironhorn, we end this AT THE</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.002" end="00:17:50.337" style="s2">HEART.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.317" end="00:17:50.337" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.502" end="00:17:54.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GO! WE HOLD THE CITY!</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.107" end="00:18:02.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.382" end="00:18:05.402" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.602" end="00:18:17.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STAY CLOSE, SKYE.</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.903" end="00:18:53.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You gave them spring.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.903" end="00:18:53.503" style="s2">I am taking back their winter.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.403" end="00:19:34.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold them, Wick.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.703" end="00:19:51.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, stop.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.603" end="00:19:56.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WICK, NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.505" end="00:20:42.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LOOK, it&#39;s coming down.</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.505" end="00:21:01.005" style="s2">This way.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.505" end="00:21:03.705" style="s2">Out. Everyone out.</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.005" end="00:21:03.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go right.</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.905" end="00:21:29.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s the base.</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.005" end="00:21:33.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara.</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.605" end="00:21:40.844" style="s2">Mara.</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.305" end="00:21:43.305" style="s2">I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.844" end="00:21:43.305" style="s2">[snorts] I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.505" end="00:22:00.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re home.</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.175" end="00:22:39.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.161" end="00:23:36.181" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.401" end="00:23:41.421" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.506" end="00:23:50.591" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mind your step, stable rat.</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.571" end="00:23:50.591" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.507" end="00:24:39.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you feeling any better today?</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.207" end="00:24:41.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A little. Still cold.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.908" end="00:24:43.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you? Have you been keeping warm?</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.908" end="00:24:45.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As warm as I can.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.408" end="00:24:45.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take these.</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.307" end="00:24:51.107" style="s2">Careful, sir. How&#39;s your breathing?</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.007" end="00:24:51.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Better when I keep moving.</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.507" end="00:24:55.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Brynn.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.807" end="00:24:55.707" style="s2">We&#39;ll look after each other.</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.307" end="00:25:20.807" style="s2">Hey.</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.107" end="00:25:20.807" style="s2">Hey, little one. Stay with me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.908" end="00:25:52.507" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.908" end="00:25:52.507" style="s2">Come on, breathe.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.192" end="00:26:04.212" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.507" end="00:26:16.107" style="s2">My mother froze in a winter like this.</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.107" end="00:26:16.107" style="s2">They took our cold, too.</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.207" end="00:26:21.607" style="s2">Not you. You hear me? Not you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.768" end="00:26:46.788" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.043" end="00:26:51.009" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.409" end="00:26:51.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There you are.</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.693" end="00:27:09.713" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.909" end="00:27:19.709" style="s2">The smallest part of a candle,</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.209" end="00:27:19.709" style="s2">but it&#39;s the part that holds the flame.</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.509" end="00:27:24.309" style="s2">Wick.</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.709" end="00:27:24.309" style="s2">That&#39;s you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.378" end="00:27:27.398" style="s2">[crying and snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.909" end="00:27:35.609" style="s2">Trying to help?</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.809" end="00:27:40.709" style="s2">That&#39;s actually useful.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.809" end="00:27:46.394" style="s2">There you go. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.614" end="00:27:51.634" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.109" end="00:27:54.809" style="s2">Good work.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.679" end="00:28:06.699" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.009" end="00:28:10.709" style="s2">It&#39;s yours, Wick. Eat.</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.509" end="00:28:16.609" style="s2">You really [music] are something.</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.014" end="00:28:44.034" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.944" end="00:28:47.964" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.410" end="00:28:56.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That [music] is not fire.</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.700" end="00:29:01.720" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.975" end="00:29:04.995" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.490" end="00:29:13.510" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.610" end="00:29:21.110" style="s2">You&#39;re not broken. [music] You&#39;re just</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.510" end="00:29:21.110" style="s2">different.</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.610" end="00:29:34.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, it&#39;s all I have.</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.710" end="00:29:34.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you&#39;ve had enough.</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.010" end="00:29:42.010" style="s2">By order of the king, all coal for the</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.310" end="00:29:42.010" style="s2">great flame.</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.785" end="00:30:11.805" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.010" end="00:30:16.710" style="s2">Stay warm.</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.110" end="00:30:16.710" style="s2">Stay warm.</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.110" end="00:30:27.010" style="s2">Just a few. No one will miss a few.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.881" end="00:30:43.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [yawns and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.912" end="00:31:01.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHO&#39;S THAT?</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.512" end="00:31:05.512" style="s2">THIEF! STOP HER!</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.976" end="00:31:15.996" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.712" end="00:31:25.012" style="s2">GET UP THERE! GO ROUND!</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.112" end="00:31:48.112" style="s2">RUN, I&#39;LL BUY SOME TIME.</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.312" end="00:32:13.712" style="s2">DAMN IT.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.113" end="00:32:47.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FOUND YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.813" end="00:33:08.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; QUICK.</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.313" end="00:33:10.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Coal from the great flame.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.213" end="00:33:10.913" style="s2">And what is this?</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.152" end="00:33:17.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.013" end="00:33:32.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s cursed.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.513" end="00:33:37.713" style="s2">DAMN IT. GET IT.</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.373" end="00:34:38.393" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.314" end="00:34:54.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GO. RUN.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.214" end="00:35:01.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HOLD ON.</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.914" end="00:35:01.214" style="s2">I&#39;M INSIDE.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.714" end="00:35:08.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU LIVED.</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.314" end="00:35:29.014" style="s2">Where is it?</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.814" end="00:35:34.414" style="s2">Who gave it to you?</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.814" end="00:35:37.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one gave him to me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.414" end="00:35:37.414" style="s2">Someone threw him away.</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.014" end="00:35:52.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The beast will come for her.</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.514" end="00:35:54.714" style="s2">Then it will come for you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.514" end="00:35:57.814" style="s2">At the lightning, you burn</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.714" end="00:35:57.814" style="s2">and the beast with you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.314" end="00:36:04.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow, Rat.</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.414" end="00:36:06.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t come back quick.</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.414" end="00:36:08.914" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.214" end="00:36:08.914" style="s2">Don&#39;t come back.</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.114" end="00:36:26.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The first is born gray.</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.114" end="00:36:39.514" style="s2">Burn it at dawn, Majesty, before it</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.414" end="00:36:39.514" style="s2">learns what it is.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.720" end="00:36:48.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.316" end="00:36:59.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go, run.</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.095" end="00:37:05.115" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.316" end="00:37:42.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The thief.</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.216" end="00:37:53.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not so brave without you, little beast.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.516" end="00:37:57.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay away,</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.716" end="00:37:57.116" style="s2">please.</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.971" end="00:38:26.991" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.516" end="00:38:35.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 300 winters the flame has kept us.</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.916" end="00:38:43.616" style="s2">300 winters</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.416" end="00:38:47.617" style="s2">tonight</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.616" end="00:38:47.617" style="s2">we burn away our weakness.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.787" end="00:39:14.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.717" end="00:39:26.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look.</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.517" end="00:39:33.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.952" end="00:39:44.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.617" end="00:39:44.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do no.</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.718" end="00:40:59.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wrench.</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.918" end="00:41:16.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wrench.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.318" end="00:41:25.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drop [screaming] it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.818" end="00:41:54.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.118" end="00:41:54.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Burn.</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.318" end="00:42:23.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WRENCH.</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.418" end="00:42:23.618" style="s2">GET UP.</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.618" end="00:42:30.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FINISH IT.</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.318" end="00:42:35.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WRENCH.</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.874" end="00:42:35.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming and groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.318" end="00:42:41.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHERE DO YOU THINK YOU&#39;RE GOING, RAT?</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.974" end="00:42:48.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.120" end="00:43:15.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Behind us!</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.170" end="00:43:34.190" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.130" end="00:43:55.620" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.620" end="00:43:58.620" style="s2">KILL IT!</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.620" end="00:43:58.620" style="s2">I COMMAND YOU!</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.320" end="00:44:22.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COME CLOSER AND SHE FREEZES WITH YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.985" end="00:44:22.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.021" end="00:45:12.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WICK.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.021" end="00:45:14.221" style="s2">They threw you into the cold. I pulled</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.821" end="00:45:17.221" style="s2">you out.</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.221" end="00:45:17.221" style="s2">I&#39;m not letting go now.</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.221" end="00:45:33.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.821" end="00:45:55.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stocking.</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.061" end="00:46:10.081" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.301" end="00:46:15.321" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.807" end="00:47:01.827" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.702" end="00:47:09.032" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.012" end="00:47:09.032" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.023" end="00:47:17.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah.</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.527" end="00:47:17.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning and screaming]</p>
</div>
</body>
